This extension adds inZOI modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#ea9999]This game does not support symlinks. You must have the mod staging folder and the game on the same drive to use this extension.[/color][/b][/size]

[size=3][b][color=#f9cb9c]UE4SS LogicMod (Blueprint) Mod Authors - You MUST include a "LogicMods" folder above your .pak file in order for this extension to install the mod to the correct location. Without this, there is no way to differentiate between LogicMod paks and regular pak mods.[/color][/b][/size]

[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs UE5 MODKit Pak mod with a "mod_manifest.json" manifest to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS Script-LogicMod Combo mod with both a "Content" and a "Binaries" folder to the "BlueClient" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS LogicMods (Blueprint) mod with a "LogicMods" folder to the "BlueClient\Content\Paks" folder.[/*]
[*]Creations (Documents) mods are installed to the "CREATIONS_PATH" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs UE Sortable Pak mod with a ".pak" file to the "BlueClient\Content\Paks\~mods" folder.[/*]
[*]AIGenerated (Documents) mods are recognised by the Aigenerated installer.[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS mod with a "dwmapi.dll" file to the "BlueClient\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Canvas (Documents) mods are recognised by the Canvas installer.[/*]
[*]Installs Mod Enabler mod with a file or folder named "dsound.dll" and a file or folder named "sig.lua".[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS Script mod with a ".lua" file and a "Scripts" folder to the "BlueClient\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs My3DPrinter (Documents) mod with a file or folder named "appearance.dat", a file or folder named "motion.dat", a file or folder named "albedo.jpg", a file with the ".glb" extension, a file with the ".dat" extension and a file with one of these extensions: ".glb" or ".dat".[/*]
[*]Installs UE4SS DLL mod with a ".dll" file and a "dlls" folder to the "BlueClient\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Animations (Documents) mods are recognised by the Animations installer.[/*]
[*]Installs Root Folder mod with a top-level folder such as "BlueClient", "Engine" or "Content" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]MyAppearances (Documents) mods are recognised by the Myappearances installer.[/*]
[*]Installs Config (Local AppData) mod with a config file such as "engine.ini" or "game.ini".[/*]
[*]Textures (Documents) mods are recognised by the Textures installer.[/*]
[*]Installs Saves (Documents) mod with a ".sav" file.[/*]
[*]Installs Binaries (Engine Injector) mod with anything unrecognised with no pak file to the "BlueClient\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

